WEBVTT

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:04.480
<i>One day, I realized I had nothing.</i>

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:06.980
<i>I'd parted ways with my family,</i>

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:09.320
<i>betrayed my friends and my organization,</i>

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:10.940
<i>and even killed my mentor.</i>

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:15.840
<i>I'd made my friends cry, lost them,</i>

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:18.450
<i>and turned my back on 
the people who loved me.</i>

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:20.340
<i>And...</i>

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:24.460
<i>I'd even cast myself aside, 
so it was only natural.</i>

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:35.910
<i>But the pockets I thought were empty</i>

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.430
<i>still had one last thing in them.</i>

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.430
I want to see you again someday.

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:47.690
<i>In order to fulfill a promise 
I both do and don't remember,</i>

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:54.470
<i>I will rewrite</i>

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:02.390
<i>the fate of the girl</i>

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:07.000
<i>who has to live alone forever in solitude.</i>

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:44.920
<i>This song is making Kagari suffer 
and trying to cause ruin.</i>

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:45.950
<i>I must stop it.</i>

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:49.080
<i>I can hear the song coming from over there.</i>

00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:52.710
<i>But if I take on everyone in my way,</i>

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.340
<i>I'll run out of steam before I get there.</i>

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:58.720
Tennouji...

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:02.690
You've got some nerve to be taking 
a leisurely stroll, you traitor.

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:12.760
Are you a Gaia spy?

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:14.000
Nah.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.420
I'm just Tennouji Kotarou, the man.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:20.110
Do you <i>want</i> to suffer as you die?

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:22.010
I can't die yet.

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:24.470
Not until I show her

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:27.790
the potential this planet has, 
and the fond memories she seeks.

00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:31.950
Just tell me this before you go to hell.

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:37.170
Just who the hell are you?

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:38.750
I'm...

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:42.180
the Earth-Saving Hunter.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:49.640
Hold it!

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:54.400
Hey!

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:57.780
He's headed toward...

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:59.420
Gaia's temple!

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:00.440
After him!

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:03.120
We'll get him and Gaia's core all at once!

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:12.430
Looks like he was hiding 
his powers all along.

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:13.790
That bastard...

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:18.180
<i>This place is too defenseless.</i>

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:22.200
<i>They must have something 
really dangerous up ahead.</i>

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:35.720
Clear the way for me.

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:43.070
Shimizu-san!

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:47.620
Talk about ironic.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:51.070
We losers are the only ones who survived.

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:51.870
Damn it!

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:05.010
Stay back.

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:15.820
This makes no sense.

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:18.020
I thought you betrayed us!

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:20.110
What's with you?

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:22.840
Why'd you hide your incredible power?

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:24.660
Why'd you deceive us?

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.780
What the hell is your game?

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:30.380
Like I told you, I'm trying 
to save the planet.

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:33.870
There's a girl I can't seduce unless I do.

00:04:35.510 --> 00:04:38.130
Wh-What do you mean, save the planet?

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:39.860
I'll stop this song.

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:43.630
Though even then, the most it'll do 
is leave us teetering on the brink.

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:48.890
Still, it'll let me pass on
the baton of potential.

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:52.640
To, let's see... Nishikujou's 
future students, I guess?

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:58.060
Oh, and while we're on the topic...

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:01.430
She's a bit of a cheeky brat,

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:04.140
but deep down, she's a 
good, kind-hearted girl.

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:06.480
Sorry I don't have any better pictures of her.

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:08.440
Her contact details are in there, too.

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:10.200
What? Wait, this...

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:12.440
Imamiya, Nishikujou.

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:14.450
I leave the future to you.

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:17.810
Why do you have to say it like that?

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:19.960
That makes it sound like you're...

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:47.640
Just one solo hunter?

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:56.910
You must be an excellent individual, 
chosen from among many by fate.

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:02.020
Monsters who live long 
become sentient, huh?

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:03.380
Gaia's guardian deity.

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:04.890
Indeed.

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:08.320
In my eyes, the Gaians are my children.

00:06:10.270 --> 00:06:15.490
All life has the right to die as it sees fit.

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:18.540
And if they wish for this ending,

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:21.400
then I shall make their wish come true.

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:25.900
In order to fulfill my children's desire,

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:30.030
I cannot let you take one 
step past here, hunter.

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:32.620
Rewrite

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:32.620
Don't Rewrite

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:33.620
Rewrite

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:46.760
<i>Oh... So I'm this far gone.</i>

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:50.680
<i>It's not even my blood anymore. 
It's my very life itself.</i>

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:54.740
<i>And it's time to call it forth.</i>

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:04.480
<i>The point of no return...</i>

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:08.860
<i>I just crossed a line from 
which I can never come back.</i>

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:55.990
You're going down, Gaia!

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:23.630
Kashima Sakura.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:28.110
Was there any meaning at all to what I did?

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:33.050
All those monsters are 
nowhere to be seen now.

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:36.900
The song is over, but the 
world still hasn't ended.

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:38.930
That means Kagari's still holding on.

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:42.340
Gaia and Guardian's conflict will soon end.

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:45.530
Won't that make a fond memory?

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.750
Tell me, Kagari.

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:57.010
Iko-san?

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:01.010
Kotarou-kun?

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:02.770
Why are you here?

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:05.390
I mean, you were doing all you could...

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:07.190
So why?

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:12.120
Because my kids had no future.

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:15.970
I'm pretty sure Akane grew 
up, slowly but surely.

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:20.830
Sakura-san was looking out for her.

00:09:21.390 --> 00:09:23.450
Where is Akane right now?

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:26.330
I sent her to the City of Stone.

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:29.830
Hey, what happened to the world?

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:32.270
It's still alive.

00:09:32.270 --> 00:09:35.720
It's filthy, sad, and cruel...

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:38.280
It's on the verge of death...

00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:39.970
But it's still alive.

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:42.530
So I failed, huh?

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:48.600
Maybe I should bring Akane-chan back here...

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:53.250
Screw that...

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:54.990
Screw that!

00:09:56.310 --> 00:09:59.540
Neither Kagari nor I have 
that much time left...

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:14.530
Akane, I still have work to do.

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:17.260
So you'll have to save yourself now.

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:21.420
I'll give you some bodyguards.

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:23.010
Dima, Lyuba.

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:35.070
You can control them?

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:36.460
Without any training?

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:40.410
Nice, Akane.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:41.490
Listen.

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:43.520
Go to the safest place you can find

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:46.270
and tell the nicest-looking 
person there this:

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:48.260
"Help me."

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:49.880
Help...

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:51.770
Yeah, just like that.

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:53.580
But stay away from lolicons.

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:54.540
Loli...?

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:57.460
Say it like you did a second ago.

00:10:57.460 --> 00:10:58.300
Got it?

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:01.080
That's the way.

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:02.140
Get going.

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:07.710
<i>I can't believe how calm and 
collected she is in this situation.</i>

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:13.520
I'm almost out of time, huh?

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:31.120
Kagari, I wanna see you...

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:40.920
<i>Why do I want to see her so badly, anyway?</i>

00:12:05.460 --> 00:12:07.370
<i>Oh, I see.</i>

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:10.910
<i>I've been chasing after her forever.</i>

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:18.500
Kagari?

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:20.580
Thank you.

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:22.290
Those were some fond memories

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:23.880
of the greatest kind.

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:26.430
Did I make it in time?

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:29.690
No, unfortunately.

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:34.630
If only I'd witnessed this world 
just a little bit sooner...

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:37.530
I'm filled with that regret.

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:40.430
Oh...

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:44.210
No need to be ashamed.

00:12:44.210 --> 00:12:48.480
You did very well, for one human.

00:12:49.060 --> 00:12:52.080
Hold your head up high, 
and finish your final task.

00:12:54.490 --> 00:12:55.280
Come.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:58.960
I can't do that

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:58.960
I can't do that

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:58.960
I can't do that

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:58.960
I can't do that

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:58.960
I can't do that

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:58.960
I can't do that

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:58.960
I can't do that

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:58.960
I can't do that        Do it

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:01.050
Do it

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:09.580
Kagari...

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:20.570
You should've done this sooner.

00:13:21.350 --> 00:13:23.820
You've always shown me the way.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:27.630
But if nothing changed, we'd never...

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:31.230
So I decided to do this myself...

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:32.900
But...

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:33.830
B-But, you know...

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:36.460
I killed so many people

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:39.660
and betrayed all their trust 
and love to get this far!

00:13:40.050 --> 00:13:42.150
I kept hope alive for the world!

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:45.220
But, after all that, I have to kill you?!

00:13:45.930 --> 00:13:47.160
It's okay.

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:49.840
This is a blessing.

00:13:50.490 --> 00:13:52.350
Like hell it is!

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:54.570
This is nothing but a curse!

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:57.090
To make me suffer!

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:00.780
The ability and the will to carve 
open a path to the future...

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:04.970
Even if you must consume 
your mother planet to do it,

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:08.210
you all must reach out to new frontiers.

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:11.120
That's what will form fond memories.

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:17.370
You did so well without my guidance.

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:20.150
Was this good enough?

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:22.790
There remains hope for the world.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:23.830
I see.

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:28.580
I only did it because I'm into you, though.

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:30.010
Into me?

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:32.120
It means I'm in love with you.

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:33.980
I didn't realize.

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:36.780
You are pretty thickheaded.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:41.360
Unrequited feelings must leave 
one feeling empty inside.

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:43.120
I'm fine with that.

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:44.560
So stupid.

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:48.150
You're just one human...

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:01.710
That's right.

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:05.240
This love story is perfect for me.

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:17.160
<i>There once lived a young man.</i>

00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:21.560
<i>A delicate young man 
who had the same worries</i>

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:24.440
<i>and sorrows as many others.</i>

00:15:25.380 --> 00:15:26.940
<i>He was a soldier.</i>

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:31.450
<i>A sinful soul who killed 
people over and over.</i>

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:35.950
<i>But he also saved many, many people,</i>

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:39.170
<i>at the cost of his own heart and life.</i>

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:49.270
<i>And he left behind</i>

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:52.830
<i>a guiding light for the weak,</i>

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:56.600
<i>despairing humans living 
on this wounded planet.</i>

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:56.120
Holder of the Guiding Light

00:15:57.800 --> 00:16:00.340
<i>We will respect his wish</i>

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:03.650
<i>and reveal what some people 
have been monopolizing,</i>

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:05.770
<i>the guiding light for our survival,</i>

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.720
<i>to the entire world.</i>

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:17.170
<i>As Earth heads toward ruin,</i>

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:19.910
<i>humanity only has one 
resource left to turn to.</i>

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.820
<i>It exists within us</i>

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:26.570
<i>as the limited yet infinite 
power that is life.</i>

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:34.600
<i>The sin of living by devouring the 
lives of people and the planet is one</i>

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:36.510
<i>the planet will surely forgive.</i>

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:40.930
<i>Because a child using its mother as 
a stepping stone on its journey</i>

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:45.030
<i>is in no way a sad memory.</i>

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.090
<i>So please don't forget the nameless young man</i>

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:52.820
<i>who carved open the path for us.</i>

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:55.680
<i>The trailblazer who led the way for us,</i>

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:57.920
<i>the holder of the guiding light.</i>

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:07.000
Did you find a good planet,

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:08.920
my beloved family?

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:16.930
Isn't this the one?

00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:19.620
It grew 500 meters tall in three years?

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:20.820
What a pain.

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:22.270
It's magnificent.

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:23.820
Has a nice color, too.

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:25.620
It looks strong and sturdy!

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:27.670
Were those all double entendres?

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:28.490
No.

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:30.320
Your mind's just in the gutter.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:32.320
Blame my genes for that.

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:40.570
What's up, Kotori?

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:45.250
It just feels very familiar, for some reason.

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:48.950
But are you sure we can 
use it without permission?

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:51.730
This is technically 
municipal property, right?

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:54.560
It won't matter if they don't find out.

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:57.630
If they do, we're in for a 
lecture from Touka-sensei!

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:00.390
Shall we get to it, then?

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:03.140
Here goes the countdown.

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:04.140
Five!

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:05.140
Four!

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:06.140
Three!

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:07.140
Two!

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:08.140
One!

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:10.400
Come on out!

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:34.670
It's almost scary how well that worked.

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:35.850
Do you hear us?

00:18:35.850 --> 00:18:38.440
You're our familiar.

00:18:38.440 --> 00:18:39.210
Yeah.

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:41.270
You'll dress like a butler

00:18:41.270 --> 00:18:43.940
and serve us like a slave.

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:44.560
Yeah.

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:47.060
Do you understand what we're saying?

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:47.560
Yeah.

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:50.190
Can't he say anything but "yeah"?

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:52.560
He was only just born. This is how it goes.

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:55.830
By the way, this place is quite warm.

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:57.660
We're in an ice age now, though.

00:18:57.660 --> 00:18:59.700
It's really cold outside the city.

00:19:00.520 --> 00:19:02.200
Well, that thing makes sense now.

00:19:02.670 --> 00:19:05.640
It's like the town is being 
sheltered by a layer of life.

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:08.960
Do you realize who and what you are?

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:09.990
Yeah.

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:11.960
I'm a monster, right?

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:15.680
My job is to wear a black tuxedo

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:17.710
and serve you, my contractors.

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:19.160
Just as we inputted!

00:19:19.160 --> 00:19:21.090
It was super effective!

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:23.530
But I respectfully decline.

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:26.570
I'm meant for bigger things,

00:19:26.570 --> 00:19:29.300
because I have a special power.

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:33.270
He suddenly started talking like

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:35.600
a college student who 
doesn't want to get a job.

00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:38.440
Actually, this is the first 
time I've seen a familiar

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:39.600
disobey its master.

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:42.510
This is why I said to avoid a humanoid.

00:19:42.510 --> 00:19:44.830
Because it'd turn into my fishmonger.

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:46.120
Your fishmonger?

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:47.790
He's sell-fish.

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:51.290
Let's leave that awful joke 
on the back burner for now.

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:52.370
He's sell-fish!

00:19:52.570 --> 00:19:55.360
I request treatment befitting my talents.

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:57.310
As long as you provide me with life,

00:19:57.310 --> 00:19:59.720
I can use it creatively

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:01.260
and do anything and everything.

00:20:01.890 --> 00:20:03.760
I have no idea what he's talking about.

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:06.770
Can you fly, then?

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:09.430
I can grow wings or sails if need be.

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:11.660
Why don't we put that to the test?

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:15.020
Take us somewhere right away.

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:16.740
Piece of cake.

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:20.730
But I have only been provided 
five drops of life so far.

00:20:20.730 --> 00:20:21.780
That's not enough.

00:20:22.050 --> 00:20:23.940
How many do you need, then?

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:27.520
At the very least, tens of 
thousands of contractors.

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:30.060
Your mileage is awful.

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:32.040
How far can we go with that many?

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:34.870
I can even leave the 
Solar System if you want.

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:37.590
Why must we go to space, anyway?

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:39.530
Why, indeed?

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:41.960
You people figure out the answer.

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:43.840
That's humanity's job.

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:44.840
Hey, Driver.

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:47.850
How far can we go with fare for five?

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:50.220
Around there, I suppose.

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:55.100
Oh, it's just a quick hop.

00:22:12.240 --> 00:22:19.370
Episode 24
"A Promise Fulfilled with You"

00:23:43.490 --> 00:23:45.270
I finally fulfilled my promise.

00:23:45.560 --> 00:23:46.520
I want to

00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:47.980
see you again someday.
